---
title: Projects
description: "Self-contained experiences by Michael Wales — simulations, games, and small tools, each living in its own world."
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<div class="projects-page">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p class="projects-intro">Self-contained experiences — simulations, games, and small tools — each living in its own world. These pages are just the doorway; step through and you'll land in something built entirely on its own terms.</p>

    <div class="projects-grid">
        {% for p in projects %}
        <a class="mw-card pcard" href="/projects/{{ p.slug }}/">
            <span class="kind"><span class="mw-badge mw-badge--dark">{{ p.card.kind }}</span></span>
            <div class="mw-card__body">
                <div><span class="mw-tag mw-tag--accent">{{ p.card.tag }}</span></div>
                <h2 class="mw-card__title">{{ p.card.title }}</h2>
                <p class="mw-card__excerpt">{{ p.card.excerpt }}</p>
                <span class="mw-meta">{{ p.card.meta }}</span>
            </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
